  "solution": "**Explanation:**\n\nWe apply the options in the given equation and solve it using the BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) ÷ and +\n\n5 - 4 + __**2 ÷ 7**__ × 3 = 14\n\n5 - 4 + __0.28__**__** × 3**__ = 14**\n__**5**__ - 4 __**+ **____0.84__ = 14\n\n__5.84** - 4**__ = 14\n\n1.84 ≠ 14\n\nOption 2) × and −\n\n5 × __**4 ÷ 2**__ + 7 - 3 = 14\n\n__**5 × **____2__** + 7 - 3 = 14**\n__**10 **____**+ 7**__ - 3 = 14\n\n__**17 - 3**__ = 14\n\n14 = 14\n\nOption 3) − and ÷\n\n__**5 ÷ 4**__ - 2 + 7 × 3 = 14\n\n1.25 - 2 + __**7 × 3**__ = 14\n\n__**1.25**__ - 2 __**+ **____21__** = 14**\n__**22.25 - 2**__ = 14\n\n20.25 ≠ 14\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\n5 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ × 7 + 3 = 14\n\n5 - __2__**__** × 7**__ + 3 = 14\n\n__**5**__ - 14 __**+ 3**__ = 14\n\n__**8 - 14**__ = 14\n\n-6 ≠ 14\n\n**Hence the correct answer is option 2.**",
